    "title": "openSAP: Free Enterprise MOOCs",
    "creator": "HPI Knowledge Engineering Team",
    "descriptionHtml": "With the openSAP mobile app for Android, you can gain knowledge on key topics for success in the SAP ecosystem anywhere and anytime. This app accesses SAP&#39;s open online courses and provides a well-structured, optimized interface for you to view available courses, download course videos, complete online tests, and synchronize your personal learning progress with the openSAP web platform.<br><br>Key features of openSAP for Android:<br>• Download weekly learning content, including videos, to study offline<br>• View courses with an easy-to-use interface for Android devices<br>• Complete online tests<br>• Access your openSAP profile and learning progress<br>• Contribute to discussion forums when online<br>• Google Cast™-enabled, watch videos on your TV with your Chromecast or Android TV device<br> <br>Note: To use the openSAP application with your personal learning data, you must be a registered user of the openSAP web site.",
